    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679">

                <pb facs="0841" n="753" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg753"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/2676: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-04T17:00:00-04:00">August 4, 1933—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>52. Your 82, and 83 and 84.<anchor n="62" xml:id="d679-f1"/> Certain difficulties
                    of a legal nature have now been raised regarding the Agreement for Financial
                    Control <pb facs="0842" n="754" xml:id="pg754"/> which require further
                    consideration. Also it appears advisable to await arrival of the Secretary the
                    first of next week. I greatly regret delay but will instruct you at the earliest
                    possible moment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
